OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after crash between two
OL,4,Acars near Dornock
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 51-year-old man has died in a crash
OL,7,Fbetween two cars in Dumfries and
OL,8,FGalloway.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the accident
OL,11,Fhappened on the B721 between Annan and
OL,12,FGretna, near Dornock, at about 09:45.
OL,14,FIt involved a grey Mini and a black
OL,15,FRange Rover. The man driving the Mini
OL,16,Fdied at the scene while a 62-year-old
OL,17,Fwoman driving the Range Rover was taken
OL,18,Fto to hospital with non-serious
OL,19,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
